{"id":"6bd720e64acf249b","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-forces-gch.md","title":"ZFC Forces GCH","display":"df-zfc-forces-gch — ZFC Forces GCH","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forces-gch","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forces-gch"],"display":"df-zfc-forces-gch — ZFC Forces GCH","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forces-gch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forces-gch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forces-gch — ZFC Forces GCH"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> are the exact ground-model and forcing predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{GCH}}\">\\(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{GCH}}\\)</span> is the fixed first-order sentence code expressing GCH</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcesGCHOver}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcesGCHOver}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}gch}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ForcesGCHOver}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle p,1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(\nM,1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_{\\mathrm{GCH}},\\varnothing,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}gch}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ForcesGCHOver}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle p,1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(\nM,1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_{\\mathrm{GCH}},\\varnothing,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ground model and top condition are explicit, and GCH is passed to the canonical forcing relation as one formula code with an empty parameter vector.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{GCH}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcesGCHOver}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}gch}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ForcesGCHOver}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle p,1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(\nM,1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_{\\mathrm{GCH}},\\varnothing,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1573,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1939","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-forces-gch.md|58-df-zfc-forces-gch]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018","66d43bb76d055059","911508dbd8495663"]}